{
  "version": 3,
  "about": "Inkborne encounter zones (Systems / Ashley). Read by encounters.js. Ids match the live data/world.json nodes, data/pois/*.json and data/enemies.json enemies. Canon enemies only: blotling, hollow_lantern, smudge_ronin (Smudge Ronin is the fixed mini-boss and never appears in random tables). `encounters` has the same shape as enemies.json `encounters` (SPEC 7) and keeps the existing 'sumikage_c' and 'sumikage_boss' entries unchanged, so it can be merged as-is. Recommended path for the integrator: data/zones.json (a separate file, not folded into enemies.json).",
  "rules": {
    "stepPx": {
      "poi": 10,
      "world": 20
    },
    "graceStepsAfterBattle": 6,
    "graceStepsOnEnter": 4,
    "note": "A step is stepPx of real travel. After minSteps, each step rolls 1/(avgSteps-minSteps); maxSteps forces an encounter. Standing still never rolls. Sumikage Wood is 1280 px wide; a straight crossing from the spawn to the Smudge Ronin clearing averages about 1 random fight on top of the 2 fixed ones (sim in test/encounters.test.mjs)."
  },
